  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:267414326181fd31dd0f1f9c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔唔……好像没办法\r\n发挥出平常的实力……",
      "source_fingerprint": "38d2cae356099d963166e3ae8ac7a022e24e8cf1f1bf51984a739e34b8598332",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf63fd87333235c5d2526d54",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎……总觉得今天提不起劲呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "656df31ff2c5672e0a82d04a685838c27ea07cdf3185e9b923d0460660dfe49e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc85a5707948c146e59c9774",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然我知道必须要积极一点，但……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b46905d3913fa5a39928809a506ba6e656d0c8fa74cb1d4ad9282c3ff8726b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7031ad984f562f72bb6214d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "又要比赛了……是吗？\r\n一直连续参赛\r\n感觉会对身体造成影响……",
      "source_fingerprint": "21802efa0f418d616ba4b1460b3f3d6cd2d9e0403ab5b02eba5b6379362d84e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7884a240b5d9d29798d2aa1d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个……不好意思，\r\n今天可不可以不要参赛，\r\n改为休息呢……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f02850c08c82727d97a9f3544df63a2aa1177c686e66356201a82d4d61e5f746",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66d091a4d65080631f2e92ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我一直在等待这个瞬间，\r\n现在已经完全准备好了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "380a6064fe4fa8fbd6a06d20c5c641c3fed7e33073f15ad765cc33a2e3bbfa46",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3ff91b294827dc76c407fa5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态调整得非常好，\r\n胜利可以说近在我们眼前了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "41efd9d1e428e5ced2c73c4cfac4b2285f1e6b71ba73c1fbacee9f72119f5ddf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:698b5c752ed48331e97eb1f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会好好发挥锻炼的成果，\r\n一定会带着胜利回来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "440490d6eec72c414769ca208cffc3b632b03b9f05fab15ce03f88fd5af3d0aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a7fb507e963bb4fd36a6489",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "或许是一直为了目标\r\n在努力的关系吧，\r\n我现在感觉状态非常好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5edb2b257814a5024f8d500b129d550c01ae356b249af18e7eb9a2e784ed6cf3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd5a6bfa445688f3cc8e0697",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉能发挥出超越平常的水平呢。\r\n我已经等不及要立刻比赛了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "10e8acc1e83bf91b9cea7b08035aee9c165c910bb7b0fd50292ded059ae25c49",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0aa9dbec3d455f696949da8d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没问题，\r\n我随时都能参赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1fa8ba0b65925d04dc193ce42e3fc4b9db9a06a7fdaea94e0038bed1ef4135b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9dac7cfbafd36c8b237e1088",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会努力拿出平时的实力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc43b511161ddde157df99436a743bf34847452cb9d282c69edc354b4adca1e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d9d317ff3f506c4e0bae01a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会把过去努力累积的一切，\r\n全都运用在比赛中。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b65ce5b9daa4ef302494e9305d36c2b573f89710cc39ded80e89a21a97f10709",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4582df91ec2933f5cd66a916",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我一定会取得胜利的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a2c18fb9e49c2bdc189d8d096a607f8bbd6b6f8a2af184331518732e8570187",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97aee7d32bd559bf634dff03",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要按照平时训练的做法，\r\n应该就没问题了……\r\n没事的，我能做得到。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc3b25f9a31db40364369944a7848406c06a7316a5efe82d768ac09d86914ad8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21c6c26f8cfd2a01a0ed5edb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要拿出全力，应该就……\r\n没事，我会想办法做到的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d25d0386f12ab5e12fec3fbdf2f90cd93048e4e273b47aa168483436cac22c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db953a7f8465776eef5fb349",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "专心、专心……呼……\r\n不要乱了心思……",
      "source_fingerprint": "57f765f6e3c4d350f02ea875e91e3ab2ae729803d497a803a637277bb1a9fd38",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43ec3332cb82fe897d58b6b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然对目前状态感到不安……\r\n但我还是会努力尽自己所能。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6bcd96d5feb197219a5bc246b247f857c324848dcb0cd2a04bdedadc6407b580",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10f59d873085b5108367a454",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不确定现在这种状态能不能赢……\r\n不，都还没开始，\r\n怎么能说这种丧气话……",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc75558042d5d13b21f572aaec2364de4ad772c950fc29ec6a1d5500d56350e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80311e522f650fa349bfc7a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在要说自己不够努力……\r\n也来不及了。\r\n得想想办法才行……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c51e1c81333b782435ead66ef16cd7610344f0c2c7cf362b511ca0d7419d39f8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9fcd78d09a2020748ab842c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要开始了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "50f188e86f3a8e4b11e3889195a5e78696dec7efbbec196eb54940fe3288b9a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:440b0672b18be0a40167ab81",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我上场了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "092de8b679dc1d62be9d0345f00b41ce5d39669391cc434ea8f1c32929be88df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae47dd09d172cff3bfdda3be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "上吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3eb5b5f74ef2384c6c0a89d001ced307776a3b463e8ad6c297c9c98980420a95",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dda6ec84e1f5f8a6e3436d71",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我必须集中精神。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ff3e4ac61eeda99b745a4f82a85a6946f61a18b4852b7057201288fb39f7111",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f200e19718c14334dfb96719",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎、哎呀…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "92ced37263a07fb0451d2c67342ef9823a873e8db389f639e6138b61855ac745",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab89e9d953964d97324a8ebf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔唔……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1dfb96d163733959e5250b066fab803d16c85e8be2ca2413aca9f44e91be5c0d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a17c4253fc017dc4b2a0b28a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "874e7497e7be8367a4f334f4c7f1d69916bd93469660e8935829876ff0311191",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa67d3f83905d25d505ee0dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不错哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9bc64d78f724628aa2f10a14412e6a6902ebe9bb012e34ce7e243365681454c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1c3cdd2ad6fe21acfbd0c20",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我明显感受到自己的成长。",
      "source_fingerprint": "caf98e865a8db9d35dcd61443990889e76920540d292b1125d2c9758262035de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12c3115b8be9983d67c6ef72",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，谢谢你。",
      "source_fingerprint": "10d36f417d7f5ef6b05c194eb078a3ea6c81ecf8065be4606e95a2a0f4b3cf8e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d39d98583ad505ff5b566f22",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的气势相当足够！开始吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7320f06f9dc69a8066a9d1d1ef59b422e090487eb9656b1f9969122b8b609868",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:795fd2c00acdbe4e9dadf4f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唯有英勇奋战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "04d10428b52a3b6e999de21cbaa20ad3e9b4296b3705f8e3b36d80e6e72f5fdf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ada5a40343cf615a058bca6e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家一起取得胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "086fb50553ccd0bf7bf9c27968725d7376720e71dcc9fd743d4174f393ac4cde",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9bea194db6c9891176d4f0c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，谢谢你。",
      "source_fingerprint": "10d36f417d7f5ef6b05c194eb078a3ea6c81ecf8065be4606e95a2a0f4b3cf8e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6dc21c9dd45c344f3906817",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没问题，我随时都能参赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ccd8e087bb557550dd77191e577137963e3891534bfbaee0b6565e3a2461fb66",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e2fc4083e2b34aac823417e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会好好发挥锻炼的成果，\r\n一定会带着胜利回来的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "baea15abe3d8ffd056aeb74583b1616c783b3725c0ae10842d19303e7ad71b7c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c40d8749351c70ba8b1a85c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，谢谢你。",
      "source_fingerprint": "10d36f417d7f5ef6b05c194eb078a3ea6c81ecf8065be4606e95a2a0f4b3cf8e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:976ce537b8934b35321a0475",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "始めますわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7809451e9957dac216d29294f59b0d22964364f0443f2e04d12dcd28fc3d8b17",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2629c0121d87155dc70b2b30",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只差一点就成功了……下次我一定要赢……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "49f19198b3cbf4a66e235eac60dab57f99f8165730ef491396916145c7d931c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cd55925edf0b4f37633a722",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要朝更高的目标迈进呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "03c207907202f136d623a81c1bf6a3256ddfcfa793a5c3ab34734d1a63910377",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf6350fe71699b10c5f35ae8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会审视该反省的点，\r\n下次继续努力……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3bf4d2ced7106bbf24bb50cc49f70246b1a27ffc1077fadceb0ebc638018a16",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90875303ce41939bd6172c49",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不能就此结束……必须重新锻炼……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "06dcfe1207837f8e96ab77fc8b860d23fce5a2658ec16bc3f4b98d30e4299bf0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cff23c9484d447f46a27967",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "祝福的喝彩……我真的很感谢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8dd7c97bc193cd5fcc7d25fc9bc928c2493265ef9cd9afe5d9030c2e639c0125",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cddfe57bca15d964f9c9e124",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵……咳，这是当然的结果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba3be7742d1b27b8c6d891ca3c636c8b8093dbeeb646c92b628e6f8143067855",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82eb1bde84281298ae189178",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "直达天际……获得了胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "61b66ce05adc36bfb2699a07f63899d3256c364a1af40749fb107c246453a65a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "30006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:396cef0d140718c8e0f5e7f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵……咳，这是当然的结果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba3be7742d1b27b8c6d891ca3c636c8b8093dbeeb646c92b628e6f8143067855",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "30007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d99d1c23324d6a258d27701",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "享用大粒草莓刨冰的难得机会……\r\n……啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "34106904b13f9a592ffee0c2341e9a8517d15f6560d58dc3e1c5dfcc5f76782c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "30206"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b88ecada02c8b4691742b82",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵……咳，这是当然的结果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba3be7742d1b27b8c6d891ca3c636c8b8093dbeeb646c92b628e6f8143067855",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "30207"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23f94f10fd14359984493514",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "胜利在我的手中！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5f0d1373b2cb8240a7b56052ec42af55482347b991796d960b680fc4c521134",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2772a155d380d6f9eab2ef4d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要上了……觉悟吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b6144386547d181dd2b4653a55bf6a38d61ecf356f4286c7ff43146e0c6515a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6e123013d5e4da1781e0da6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没想到连我都得参加……\r\n但既然要比，就要拿出全力，\r\n这才是目白家的精神。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6695e641d071bc9dbb1214e0d50a409619ab32b8c014e9898e4b771b2fde051e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "400000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dcb601a4de61f9f6659d0121",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哪怕后浪推前浪……\r\n我也不会把胜利拱手让人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0828751be6c7471c3196002f937b30abe71073427e1db7203637dc7f92c9d590",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "400001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d93b3f2c26a8a32bb1712084",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "帝王总是一有机会\r\n就凭着感觉加入即兴演出……\r\n要配合她也很不容易耶。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2936c43dc093b75108514cf0bd6311d7d7867088df7924dd2558b5e5b00c8532",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "400005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d53def54740bbeaeeb5b834",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一决胜负的时刻来临了呢。\r\n我发誓会以不辱目白之名的表现，\r\n优雅地赢得胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2eaa40cbef6ae757736c56a99c1bfccae750e138e4e0f011fe18a0b72a730c88",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "400006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e474672a23946a5d9ef61bd7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "直舞不存在学年等因素的隔阂。\r\n就算有尊敬的前辈参加……\r\n也能站上顶点哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1391004cd8f59dc471a4caaa407547fd08adf48ff3910f8b88684d2990bd4116",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "400007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb16bb58aaefbba65e19e965",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼……时机来临了……我要上了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c62b76ea379f29b8665a0e0700c9ea4458230fb221419678a4cfb1b0d5d6e269",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d88442e68ac78103ae1bb79",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "也得稍微感谢一下黄金船才行呢。\r\n只有稍微而已喔……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "30c42a7062879ff96cacc8e75e6ec971e4861e9dcffb20adb3731a9af298ebc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "400010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae7386f804b4afc97abec024",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "振翅高飞！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ec9dc00ba7f5432822d83b3753075efcec4b0eff973133c6aa9242880c0d5ea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c67005015c150533ecb2b5ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会拍动这双翅膀……不断地更上一层楼！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8829d35dbc97c90ffca44078f1111320a25ec1afb6cc7c1e5f2a7d1a6ea549cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7abb82f144c262bb4d556bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一起在夏日中奔跑吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "17d18b676d64da7a6421bc702d75052cfd9c90b483a71376222354e1c4bbfcc5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "40203"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd7fc5ec1e44aa96cdcc67bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在夏日光芒之中与你共度的时光……\r\n一定会无比美丽。",
      "source_fingerprint": "99d1c9694c41150ae97a8dc9222c24ab5597d29b30621b2d2a025f96fd1e9bb4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "40204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a635b715a6c00b8a215a0bc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论是比赛还是演唱会，我都会尽全力……",
      "source_fingerprint": "913b868983ea37dce3f96f579b18bb55b016130304b9b72f25bbf9b36383bdbd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b87f9c442eaa1aa70bdcaed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……好，那我就上场了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e84ac3c6ae31ffd6f646e952808ccc6a1c71a6937a3576e875c891e08a89e93e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7956d36f9387d4ea766cacaf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们一起前进吧……朝夙愿前进。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec0d54fe97a5b7179a831a647e3abb0cd44689bea6891894872b39554c5a3330",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebfdd5f396b45a19be3a25f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刚开始我还只是个\r\n连自我管理都做不好的人。\r\n能遇到可靠的训练员，真的很庆幸。",
      "source_fingerprint": "93d6c04a85cf9dd590810559c643e3aa4d9ff6a7c2a896d1a6bfe39b0261b7fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e1e537163b8f2471005cce4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿着奶奶也穿过的这套制服……\r\n自然地就会挺起胸膛呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "292346408609090c5bb6752dd94947f21032fd43db242d6f46c396f65ec3e576",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d746ce6963f3a58df8897715",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "处理褶边……我可是很拿手的♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa3a2ea222a78f8066bb65e4fd594811a7b7886f50afe4e7a332e687a200cedc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:089773fd401e5ce45e811bc6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让你看看我独具一格的跑法。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b40c72f9a530d8816b217eb1ede3039c65846374c72ab805c4a8731062885af6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15dfff161cecdac68872a5e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我、我口袋里……才没有糖果呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1e5832d5f86b634eb339f4f84378aa4a69ac0da4169b58d722272077073b361",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03a2af79e4b539a3d824687d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只有腰间的这部分……感觉很不自在呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c8c842575926daf2c9a09b635098ca3f3155ae6c0f34c4bc179f3f3387d5b5e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b8a353e71bad16f23747ca3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "目白家的荣耀、使命与觉悟……能使我变强。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf75504041ee17dc7b274948bc49e4f2e938796c33348646d287f4268f233aa6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f9184b33e9cc721fe46c2b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个打扮既优美又轻便吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b84271245339dc5b92427e161c604d667621bd59edd9e1c3397702b892b4b554",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e964a24dc371a09dffcf5958",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉可以直冲天际。",
      "source_fingerprint": "de01da4369c1f9591c75bdd54cb90631e44ad5a084b4bd3ecb5054f02ce813a7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aaffc1597e97eed650b721e4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太出色了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f2e50b04f53a97d3c8fc68fb6618c8c00126b7a1a68f31cc320a96de53e936a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82a0a39b05b8dc23f375f892",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让你们见识见识目白家的实力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b9a565d4b1fd96eed15b063e9394aa6eb60890a5678a3b8e9dbf91ce423c7a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fdf6cc4d48f07bec58900858",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "假日的打扮也得展现优雅，\r\n才配得上目白之名。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d566c6c9deaeeda8f05fe0e642bc4d58bab85086567416161537622bdb34e3af",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e665d9937317543e1c2603b4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "难得休假，\r\n希望能度过有意义的一天。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8bfee7e26fe53fea9f0f955724dc49258f006102df2a29a60c451fac406d808b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2baf2808e9832d814b72e456",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我列了一张清单，\r\n海边、游泳池……该从哪项开始呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "abc5ad6a286494cdda02b9f5c67fa0f8d6d93f10dfae76643c38f7bd09bac9e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "70216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:faea7b6dbe7c859cf5ab0420",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "其实我对水上摩托车有点兴趣……\r\n只、只是稍微有兴趣而已！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6411c5e30e37f68e1f35c6e0ea492d797b13e6a5ccd27b1fe9a5720be86e6be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "70217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab4f50cf8f15cd4e9f054f9d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿着奶奶也穿过的这套制服……\r\n自然地就会挺起胸膛呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "292346408609090c5bb6752dd94947f21032fd43db242d6f46c396f65ec3e576",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "71004"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
